{"text": "The project TalePrints aims to contribute to the health of students' minds by providing tools to expand the frontiers of their imagination.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt75__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "Naim Louati is the creator of the TalePrints project.", "dimensions": ["team"], "type": "team_member", "primary_dimension": "team", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt75__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "The TalePrints project was launched on Kickstarter.", "dimensions": ["feasibility"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "feasibility", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt75__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "The funding goal for the TalePrints project was $35,307.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"suspect_numeric": false, "proposal_id": "kt75__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "The funding period for the TalePrints project was from June 8, 2016, to July 8, 2016.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"suspect_numeric": false, "proposal_id": "kt75__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "The TalePrints project was unsuccessful in reaching its funding goal.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt75__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "The project was last updated on July 8, 2016.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "feasibility"], "type": "milestone", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"suspect_numeric": false, "proposal_id": "kt75__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "The creator expressed concern about children focusing on distractions that prevent them from exploring their imagination.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt75__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "The creator believes that the ability to explore imagination is essential for human social evolution.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt75__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "The creator warns that neglecting imagination could lead future generations to a society governed by animalistic desires.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt75__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "TalePrints is a project aimed at addressing the decline in imagination among future generations.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt75__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "TalePrints.com is a new computer program designed to work with schools.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "product", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt75__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "The program aims to encourage children to utilize their imagination and improve their writing and reading skills.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt75__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "The project addresses the issue of children being distracted by movies, games, and superficial media.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt75__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "In a classroom scenario, children aged between 11 and 12 years are grouped into six groups of five.", "dimensions": ["strategy"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "strategy", "meta": {"suspect_numeric": false, "proposal_id": "kt75__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "Each group will choose a leader or have one appointed by a teacher.", "dimensions": ["strategy"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "strategy", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt75__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "The leader's task is to begin a story and guide the group in their writing.", "dimensions": ["strategy"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "strategy", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt75__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "The project involves a classroom of thirty children aged between 11 and 12 years, divided into six groups of five children each.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"suspect_numeric": false, "proposal_id": "kt75__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "Each group will choose a leader or have one appointed by a teacher.", "dimensions": ["team"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "team", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt75__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "The leader's task is to begin a story and ensure that group members adhere to the leader's main vision.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt75__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "Group members will add to the story while following specific rules and limitations.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt75__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "At the end of a specified time period, the stories will be completed, edited, and printed.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt75__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "Parents will have the option to buy the printed books, ensuring the project's survival for future generations.", "dimensions": ["feasibility"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "feasibility", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt75__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "The project anticipates potential challenges with the publishing companies used to print the books.", "dimensions": ["feasibility"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "feasibility", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt75__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "The challenges with publishing companies are considered minor and easily solvable if they arise.", "dimensions": ["feasibility"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "feasibility", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt75__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "The project 'TalePrints' is created by Naim Louati.", "dimensions": ["team"], "type": "team_member", "primary_dimension": "team", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt75__openai", "chunk_index": 3, "char_start": 4200, "char_end": 5711}}
{"text": "'TalePrints' is currently 107% funded with 10 days left in the campaign.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"suspect_numeric": false, "proposal_id": "kt75__openai", "chunk_index": 3, "char_start": 4200, "char_end": 5711}}
{"text": "The project is hosted on Kickstarter.", "dimensions": ["feasibility"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "feasibility", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt75__openai", "chunk_index": 3, "char_start": 4200, "char_end": 5711}}
{"text": "The project has a FAQ section for questions.", "dimensions": ["feasibility"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "feasibility", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt75__openai", "chunk_index": 3, "char_start": 4200, "char_end": 5711}}
{"text": "The project can be reported to Kickstarter.", "dimensions": ["feasibility"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "feasibility", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt75__openai", "chunk_index": 3, "char_start": 4200, "char_end": 5711}}
{"text": "There are similar projects available for users to check out.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt75__openai", "chunk_index": 3, "char_start": 4200, "char_end": 5711}}
{"text": "The currency used on Kickstarter is US Dollar (USD).", "dimensions": ["feasibility"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "feasibility", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt75__openai", "chunk_index": 3, "char_start": 4200, "char_end": 5711}}
